{"source_id": "C025:p002:s0009:t0013", "parent_source_id": "C025:p002:s0009", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_count": 1, "book": "本草求真", "heading": "寒澀", "source_path": "C/C025.txt", "text": "未可輕與龍骨牡蠣粟殼微寒之藥為比也。\n\n（卵生）內服斂肺瀉火除熱止嗽固脫外祛風濕殺蟲五倍子（專入肺脾）。按書既載味酸而澀。", "target_original": "本草求真(C025)/002-上編.md", "translation_chunk_index": 13, "translation_chunk_count": 110, "sentence_count": 3}
